<title>USA: Barr Laboratories Inc Q1 net income slips.</title>
<headline>Barr Laboratories Inc Q1 net income slips.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, N.Y. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(thousands of dollars except share amounts)  (unaudited)</p>
<p>					     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						 September 30,</p>
<p>					    1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $64,231	   $54,176</p>
<p> Net earnings			  1,767	     2,201</p>
<p>PER COMMON SHARE:</p>
<p>Earnings per common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent shares	 0.12		0.15</p>
